   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Thwaites Glacier:** in **West Antarctica**; called the **'Doomsday Glacier'**."
  },
  {
   "book": 6,
   "row": 79,
   "sec": 3,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Eye of a tropical cyclone:** calm, with light winds and clear skies; the **strongest winds are in the eyewall** around the eye."
  },
  {
   "book": 6,
   "row": 79,
   "sec": 4,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Four waste streams:** the SWM Rules, 2026 mandate segregation at source into **four** streams – wet, dry, sanitary and special-care."
  }
